'''Belial''' (ベリアル, ''Beriaru'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Belial
|image = E 320.png
|appearance = [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 900¢ - 3,555¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a [[Strengthen|strengthen]] ability, which activates when he is lower than 50% health and boosts his damage by 50%. Belial also has very fast movement speed and a lot of knockbacks, combined with Area Attack.

When he is at higher strength magnifications in later parts of the event, Belial can do devastating damage.

